---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="About ZeroBlue" description="Learn about ZeroBlue Technology Solutions and our commitment to building custom FileMaker and web solutions" />
	</head>
	<body class="site-body">
		<Header />
		
		<section class="hero-panel">
			<div class="hero-grid">
				<div>
					<div class="eyebrow"><span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span>Small team, practical systems</div>
					<h1 class="hero-title">About ZeroBlue</h1>
					<p class="hero-subtitle">
					Building custom FileMaker and web solutions that streamline your operations and improve efficiency.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		
		<main class="site-main">
			<!-- What We Live By Section -->
			<section class="py-16">
				<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
					<h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-12 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 tracking-tight text-center">What We Live By</h2>
					<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
						<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-600/5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-sky-500/10 hover:border-sky-500/50">
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-sky-500">Be truthful</h3>
							<p class="text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
								If we bill by the hour, we will only charge you for hours worked, no extra buffer. For larger projects we assess the work and give you a fix bid that we stick to.
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-600/5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-sky-500/10 hover:border-sky-500/50">
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-sky-500">Be adventurous</h3>
							<p class="text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
								Technology changes, so should we. We thrive on learning continuously so we can provide you with cutting-edge solutions.
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-600/5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-sky-500/10 hover:border-sky-500/50">
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-sky-500">Be mindful</h3>
							<p class="text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
								We're a small business just like you. We understand words like budget and we use layman's terms.
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-600/5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-sky-500/10 hover:border-sky-500/50">
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-sky-500">Be available</h3>
							<p class="text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
								You can find us by email, phone and chat when you need us. We respond to most support requests within hours.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Who We Are Section -->
			<section class="py-16">
				<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
					<h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-12 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 tracking-tight text-center">Who We Are</h2>

					<!-- Agnes Riley - Founder -->
					<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-600/5">
						<div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:items-start">
							<img
								src="/images/2026/05/agnes-riley-headshot-300x300.jpg"
								srcset="/images/2026/05/agnes-riley-headshot-300x300.jpg 300w, /images/2026/05/agnes-riley-headshot.jpg 1200w"
								sizes="(max-width: 767px) 220px, 220px"
								alt="Agnes Riley"
								width="300"
								height="300"
								class="w-48 md:w-full aspect-square rounded-xl object-cover shadow-md shadow-zinc-600/10"
							/>
							<div>
								<h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-sky-500">Agnes Riley</h3>
								<p class="text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mb-6">Founder, Chief Architect</p>
								<div class="space-y-4">
									<p class="text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
										Agnes held several positions in Hungary that were not IT-related, but always ended up solving computer-related issues. It was not until she came to New York that she had her first IT job. The last decade revolved around systems, networking, graphic and web design and, later, more and more FileMaker development—what was once done as a hobby became a full-time profession.
									</p>
									<p class="text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
										Her background runs from requirements analysis, business process, and database-driven applications to television production and hands-on community outreach. In high school, she helped run a rehabilitation center outreach program, recruiting students to spend weekly time with people with disabilities through walks, movies, conversation, and simple human attention. Later, working as an assistant director in television taught her to stay resourceful when plans change and people still need direction.
									</p>
									<p class="text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
										She excels at creating clean interfaces and user-friendly applications. When not at her desk, she enjoys learning about new technology, photography, skiing, and riding her motorcycle.
									</p>
									<div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700">
										<a href="https://agnesriley.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-sky-500 hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors">
											More
										</a>
									</div>
									<div class="flex gap-4 mt-6">
										<a href="https://twitter.com/agir" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sky-500 hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors" aria-label="Twitter">
											<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M23 3a10.9 10.9 0 01-3.14 1.53 4.48 4.48 0 00-7.86 3v1A10.66 10.66 0 013 4s-4 9 5 13a11.64 11.64 0 01-7 2c9 5 20 0 20-11.5a4.5 4.5 0 00-.08-.83A7.72 7.72 0 0023 3z"></path></svg>
										</a>
										<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/agnesriley" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sky-500 hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors" aria-label="LinkedIn">
											<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 016 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 00-2-2 2 2 0 00-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 016-6zM2 9h4v12H2z"></path><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"></circle></svg>
										</a>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
